WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,610
The big boss won’t really agree, right?

2
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:04,000
The senior sister said that Li Dajun is not a good person

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:07,220
The big boss is not a fool. There is no need.

4
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:20,670
There are so many people and it’s messy. It’s nice for us to have less people, Mr. Xiao.

5
00:00:20,830 --> 00:00:21,830
Can I change something?

6
00:00:21,830 --> 00:00:22,750
Clothes Yanba

7
00:00:22,750 --> 00:00:23,710
Anything else is fine

8
00:00:23,910 --> 00:00:24,990
The swap is over

9
00:00:25,350 --> 00:00:26,550
You can discuss it with the villagers

10
00:00:26,830 --> 00:00:46,030
Maybe we can change it to something like getting in the car first. Don't look at me, little lady. You're heavy over there and I'll be divided a little bit. You don't need to go first. Hurry up and leave. That's all.

11
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:48,060
It’s not easy for Mr. Xiao to start

12
00:00:48,260 --> 00:00:49,340
I need you to teach

13
00:00:49,820 --> 00:00:51,100
Why were you fawning over him so much just now?

14
00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:54,670
You would be at a disadvantage if you followed me, but for me

15
00:00:55,190 --> 00:00:57,870
Your wife and children have long since starved to death with you. Don’t forget that.

16
00:00:58,110 --> 00:00:59,790
Who rescued you in the service area?
